<title>USA: USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</title>
<headline>USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA cattle on feed,</p>
<p>1,000-plus head feedlots (data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    7 MAJOR STATES --  Pct----1997-----1996     1995</p>
<p> On Feed July 1	  117   7,679    6,578    7,734</p>
<p>During June:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 115   1,224    1,068    1,356</p>
<p> -Marketed		 102   1,732    1,696    1,754</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance   94	44	 47	 50</p>
<p> On Feed June 1	  113   8,231    7,253    8,182</p>
<p>The seven major states are Arizona, California, Colorado, Iowa, Kansas, Nebraska and Texas.</p>
<p>USDA cattle on feed in the United States (1,000-plus head feedlots, data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    U.S. TOTAL --	Pct----1997-----1996</p>
<p> On Feed July 1	  114   8,958    7,840</p>
<p>During June:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 111   1,444    1,305</p>
<p> -Marketed		 102   2,041    1,996</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance   86	60	 70</p>
<p> On Feed June 1	  112   9,615    8,601</p>
</text>
